IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SUPER8-HUDSON-RENDERMAN.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-SHUTTER-BASE-DEG  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-SUPER8-STAGE.
   05 D1-SHUTTER-ANGLE-DEG PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-CLAW-PHASE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-SHADOW-SHUTTER    PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-HUDSON-VDC-VCE.
   05 D2-VDC-CLIP-X        PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-VCE-PALETTE-IDX   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-EXPOSURE-Q16      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-VCE-RGB565        PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R12.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R13.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 360 TO D0-SHUTTER-BASE-DEG.
    MOVE 180 TO D1-SHUTTER-ANGLE-DEG.
    MOVE 0 TO D1-CLAW-PHASE.
    MOVE 320 TO D2-VDC-CLIP-X.
    MOVE 256 TO D2-VCE-PALETTE-IDX.

    PERFORM STAGE-SUPER8-EXPOSURE.
    PERFORM STAGE-HUDSON-PALETTE.
    PERFORM EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D1-SHADOW-SHUTTER == D1-SHUTTER-ANGLE-DEG AND D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE >= 875
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-SUPER8-EXPOSURE.
    MOVE D1-SHUTTER-ANGLE-DEG TO D1-SHADOW-SHUTTER.
    COMPUTE D2-EXPOSURE-Q16 = (D1-SHUTTER-ANGLE-DEG * 65536) / 360.
    COMPUTE D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE = 875 + ((125 * D2-EXPOSURE-Q16) / 65536).
    EXIT.

STAGE-HUDSON-PALETTE.
    COMPUTE D2-VCE-RGB565 = (D2-VCE-PALETTE-IDX * 65535) / 511.
    EXIT.

EVALUATE-COMMIT.
    COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = ((((D2-VDC-CLIP-X + D2-VCE-RGB565) * 1000 + 43605) * D2-G-SWIGLU-GATE) / 1000).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
